    "semantic_summary": "This component serves as the presentation layer for displaying user confirmation prompts within the application. It subscribes to a global request stream managed by ConfirmationService to react to necessary prompts. Its primary role is to expose public methods, `confirm()` and `cancel()`, which relay the user's decision back to the service before closing the modal UI state."
